{"id":"n54083-1-8","stage":5,"title":"떳떳하다 · 正大光明","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54083-1-8-1","ko":"너는 항상 열심히 사는 것 같아.","zh":"你看起来总是过得很努力啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地。","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"사는","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사는","audio":"/audio/30f3407ddedb23e84811.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac3e2be158f41d2d7dcf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54083-1-8-2","ko":"나는 우리 아이들한테 떳떳한 엄마가 되고 싶거든.","zh":"我希望能成为让孩子们引以为傲的妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들한테","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들한테","audio":"/audio/d29d1d25b29e7c2ea162.mp3"}},{"text":"떳떳한","meaning":"正大光明，堂堂正正","explanation":"떳떳하다：正大光明，堂堂正正；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"떳떳하다","audio":"/audio/7c06000b0d2fc8919774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54083","senseId":"1","lemma":"떳떳하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떳떳한","audio":"/audio/3dac14034a202735a55c.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마가","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마가","audio":"/audio/2e1aa7412bb8a19dded5.mp3"}},{"text":"되고","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되고","audio":"/audio/73e51fe845fa66b6fb7d.mp3"}},{"text":"싶거든.","meaning":"希望","explanation":"싶다：希望；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"4","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶거든","audio":"/audio/7699aa55e8f66fc96481.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"7c06000b0d2fc891","term":"떳떳하다","zh":"正大光明，堂堂正正","audio":"/audio/7c06000b0d2fc8919774.mp3","entryId":"54083","definition":"问心无愧，理直气壮。","pronunciation":["떧떠타다"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"希望","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示盼望前面内容能够实现或有做前面行动的想法。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/173a104ddf5e13ce7044.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.322,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54083","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0473,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你看起来总是过得很努力啊。","我希望能成为让孩子们引以为傲的妈妈。","看来春天真的到来了呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看起来总是过得很努力啊。","我希望能成为让孩子们引以为傲的妈妈。","看来春天真的到来了呢。"],"answer":1}]}
